        "28. 除法法则"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "负数的除法和正数除法的意义相同：就是已知两个因数",
        "的积和其中的一个因数，求另一个因数."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "例如，$-12$除以$-4$，就是求数$x$，使",
        "$-4\\cdot x=-12$."
      ]
    },
